Xournal++ 1.3.8 reference installation: licence and corresponding source

xournalpp-1.3.8-Ubuntu-noble-x86_64.deb in this directory is the unmodified
official Xournal++ 1.3.8 release package for Ubuntu 24.04 (noble), x86_64,
published at https://github.com/xournalpp/xournalpp/releases/tag/v1.3.8
(sha256 246f1767ac135f5cda8e4c0518f3a42e4122ae7710d5ae254709bdee32d42ff0).
solve.sh unpacks it into /app/solution/xournalpp without changing any file; it
leaves out the directory usr/share/xournalpp/plugins (the bundled Lua
plug-ins, all disabled by default). The launcher files start.sh and sandbox.py
belong to this task and are not part of Xournal++.

